From e479522ee2bfeb98c9cd91c2847468654abe0c48 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 08:12:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(gateway): keep local-session recovery off the loop
 watchdog

Receipt and admission rows are read in chunks on the loop and applied
before the next await, 100 sessions at a time, with asyncio.sleep(0)
between batches. Cold boot and hot-serve use that pass, and compression
catch-up is batched the same way, before the authority is published.
Watchdog defaults are unchanged.

Co-authored-by: Aurora Capital <auroracapital@users.noreply.github.com>
